# What this project is responsible for, and what happens when it breaks.
level: 1
owner: Eli Ferres
monitor: GitHub Actions on every push
rollback: git revert and re-tag
migrations: n/a: no state, reads log files only
backups: n/a: the tool keeps no data of its own and only reads existing log files
authz: n/a: no trust boundary, a local command-line tool
